🔹 Stored Procedure কী?
👉 Database এর ভিতরে stored SQL code block
👉 একবার লিখে রাখো, পরে বারবার call করা যায়
👉 👉 simpleভাবে:
“Reusable SQL program”

🔥 Basic Syntax
CREATE PROCEDURE GetCustomers
AS
BEGIN
    SELECT * FROM Customers;
END;


call করতে:
EXEC GetCustomers;


🔹 Parameter সহ Procedure

CREATE PROCEDURE GetCustomerByCountry
    @Country VARCHAR(50)
AS
BEGIN
    SELECT * 
    FROM Customers
    WHERE Country = @Country;
END;

👉 call:
EXEC GetCustomerByCountry 'Bangladesh';



3️⃣ DML SP
👉 INSERT / UPDATE / DELETE

CREATE PROCEDURE AddCustomer
    @Name VARCHAR(50),
    @Score INT
AS
BEGIN
    INSERT INTO Customers(FirstName, Score)
    VALUES(@Name, @Score);
END;
exec AddCustomer @Name = 'Nazrul', @score = 99


